a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://crazygrouptrio.itch.io/the-mariana-sequence#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4939413/the-mariana-sequence\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_anonymous-pro\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"The Mariana Sequence\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTQ0NjQ3LmpwZw==/original/ApCVke.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">The Mariana Sequence</h1></div><div itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" id=\"view_game_6547415\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://crazygrouptrio.itch.io/the-mariana-sequence/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$10.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>The Mariana Sequence is a standalone sequel to Tryptic, keeping that same &quot;game within a game&quot; aspect, and was developed in NESMaker. The game won Best Narrative in the NESdev contest Byte-Off V and was a finalist in the MAGFest 2026 Indie Retro Showcase.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTQ0ODMzLmdpZg==/original/VZC9AK.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>The Mariana Sequence is an experimental platformer for the NES with an adventure-choosing mechanic that makes the game uniquely different each time you play, as every choice you make as a player affects the game&#x27;s seed. You take the role of Cal, a subject in the Mariana Sequence Project, and are tasked with using a piece of software, a game that seems simple on the surface. The object of the game is to explore, uncover secrets and hidden paths, until you discover the correct sequence of events to reach the end and uncover the true The Mariana Sequence. Nothing in the game is randomized, meaning you can take notes and map out paths to track down the true Sequence.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTQ0NTkyLmdpZg==/original/C5rFzk.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/crazygrouptrio/the-mariana-sequence-nes-game\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">The Mariana Sequence ran a successful Kickstarter releasing the title on physical game cartridges</a>.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.513