community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:17306815,&quot;user_id&quot;:19068166}\" id=\"post-17306815\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" title=\"Vote up\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" title=\"Vote down\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/amy900\" class=\"avatar_container\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/amy900\">amy900</a></span><span title=\"2026-09-09 19:29:09\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17306815\">26 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span><span class=\"downvotes\">(-4)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>Honestly, this looks like such a creative and ambitious project! I really love the “game within a game” idea, and the fact that every choice affects the sequence makes it feel like something you’d genuinely want to replay and explore. Winning Best Narrative and becoming a MAGFest finalist is seriously impressive&mdash;you should be proud of what you’ve built.</p>\r\n<p>By the way, are you currently looking to hire or collaborate with any developers, artists, or other creative people for your future projects?\r\n</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:17291137,&quot;user_id&quot;:19067510}\" id=\"post-17291137\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" title=\"Vote up\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" title=\"Vote down\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fcrazygrouptrio.itch.io%2Fthe-mariana-sequence&amp;intent=community\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/amy-619\" class=\"avatar_container\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/amy-619\">Amy_619</a></span><span title=\"2026-09-07 23:23:43\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17291137\">28 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"downvotes\">(-4